msgid "The new notes folder cannot be inside the current notes folder."
msgstr "新的筆記資料夾不能位於目前的筆記資料夾裡面。"

msgid "The note title is derived from the first meaningful line."
msgstr "筆記標題取自第一行有內容的文字。"

msgid "The selected destination is not a folder."
msgstr "選擇的目標不是資料夾。"

msgid "The selected folder is on a read-only filesystem and cannot store notes."
msgstr "選擇的資料夾位於唯讀的檔案系統上，無法存放筆記。"

msgid "There is not enough disk space to move your notes to that folder."
msgstr "磁碟空間不足，無法把筆記移到該資料夾。"

msgid "This permanently removes the note from disk. This action can't be undone."
msgstr "這會把筆記從磁碟上永久移除。這項操作無法復原。"

