msgid "Tree lines under H2 sections"
msgstr "在 H2 章節下顯示樹狀連線"

msgid "Turn the current line into a heading"
msgstr "把目前這行變成標題"

msgid "Tweak the right-hand outline panel and the breadcrumb strip above the editor."
msgstr "調整右側的大綱面板與編輯器上方的路徑列。"

msgid "Underline misspellings while you type and offer corrections in the right-click menu."
msgstr "輸入時為拼字錯誤加上底線，並在右鍵選單提供修正建議。"

